---
title: Feature Flags
---

Feature flags let you enable or disable specific capabilities of the app without changing any source code. Each shared flag is a boolean `true` / `false` value in `app-config.json`.

## Media Controls

| JSON path | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `videoSettings.allowCameraControl` | `true` | Show the camera on/off toggle |
| `videoSettings.allowVideoOnJoin` | `true` | Start with camera enabled when joining |
| `audioSettings.allowMicrophoneControl` | `true` | Show the microphone on/off toggle |
| `audioSettings.allowAudioOnJoin` | `true` | Start with microphone enabled when joining |
| `audioSettings.allowAdvancedNoiseSuppression` | `true` | Enable the advanced noise-suppression toggle |
| `videoSettings.allowBackgroundEffects` | `true` | Enable virtual background and blur effects |

## Device Selection

| JSON path | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `waitingRoomSettings.allowDeviceSelection` | `true` | Show device selectors in the waiting room |
| `waitingRoomSettings.allowSettings` | `true` | Show Advanced Settings in the waiting room |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowDeviceSelection` | `true` | Show device selectors inside the meeting room |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowSettings` | `true` | Show Advanced Settings inside the meeting room |

## In-Call Features

| JSON path | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowArchiving` | `true` | Enable meeting recording |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowCaptions` | `true` | Enable live captions |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowCaptionTranslation` | `true` | Let users choose a translation language when captions are enabled |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowChat` | `true` | Enable the in-call group chat |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowEmojis` | `true` | Enable emoji reactions |
| `meetingRoomSettings.allowScreenShare` | `true` | Enable screen sharing |
| `meetingRoomSettings.showParticipantList` | `true` | Show the participant list panel |

## Room Behaviour

| JSON path | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `appSettings.enableReportIssue` | `true` | Show the in-call issue reporting tool |
| `appSettings.showVideoStats` | `false` | Show the video statistics overlay |
| `waitingRoomSettings.bypassWaitingRoom` | `false` | Skip the waiting room and join directly |

## Localization

| JSON path | Default |
|----------|---------|
| `localizationSettings.fallbackLanguage` | `en` |
| `localizationSettings.supportedLanguages` | `en`, `en-US`, `es`, `es-MX`, `it`, `de`, `ja` |

## Example: Minimal Read-Only Viewer

To create a stripped-down experience with no interactive tools, you might disable several flags at once:

```json
{
  "appSettings": {
    "enableReportIssue": false
  },
  "meetingRoomSettings": {
    "allowArchiving": false,
    "allowCaptions": false,
    "allowChat": false,
    "allowEmojis": false,
    "allowScreenShare": false,
    "showParticipantList": false
  }
}
```

The snippet shows the sections being changed, not a complete replacement file. Keep all required settings already present in `app-config.json`.

## Mini Mode and Post-Call Transcription

`ALLOW_MINI_MODE` and `ALLOW_POST_CALL_TRANSCRIPTION` are not generated from `app-config.json` yet. To change them, set them in `frontend/.env` and restart the development server:

```sh
ALLOW_MINI_MODE=false
ALLOW_POST_CALL_TRANSCRIPTION=false
```

{% aside type="tip" %}
Background effects (`videoSettings.allowBackgroundEffects`) are only supported in Chromium-based browsers. If your audience uses Firefox or Safari, consider disabling this flag to avoid showing an unsupported feature.
{% /aside %}

You have reviewed all the feature flags. Next, you will look at display defaults like resolution and room layout.
